  "interpretation": "The ultrametric forbidden window: for F_L between first_R_positive and the Maity threshold 0.874, the model predicts R=0 even though the logical fidelity is below the no-go threshold \u2014 a window the smooth Archimedean ramp fills. Gap width = F_c_maity - first_R_positive_F, tuning from 0 at alpha=0 (uniform coupling, Archimedean limit) to wide at large alpha (deep ultrametric hierarchy). This is the falsifiable signature: a device whose R-vs-F_L curve shows an empty window below 0.874, with the window width controlled by the coupling hierarchy, is the ultrametric prediction."
